WEBVTT

01:36.500 --> 01:39.970
[NORTHWARD]

01:40.080 --> 01:41.900
[Episode 9]

01:42.000 --> 01:43.229
Xie Wanghe, you think you're

01:43.229 --> 01:44.750
really smart, don't you?

01:44.970 --> 01:46.860
You think it's that easy to start a business?

01:47.470 --> 01:48.820
You think so?

01:49.070 --> 01:50.870
Well, if you're talking about studying,

01:50.870 --> 01:51.870
I'm really not that great.

01:51.870 --> 01:52.950
But if you're talking about starting a business,

01:53.000 --> 01:54.539
I'm much better than them.

01:54.710 --> 01:56.080
And I'm all prepared.

01:56.100 --> 01:57.340
Don't give me that.

01:57.789 --> 01:58.509
You only have one year left.

01:58.509 --> 01:59.509
Just study hard

01:59.509 --> 02:01.070
and get your graduation certificate.

02:01.270 --> 02:02.750
You can do whatever you want in the future.

02:03.190 --> 02:04.190
Didn't you say

02:04.190 --> 02:05.510
we must not waste our youth?

02:05.510 --> 02:06.510
I'm just taking a break from school,

02:06.510 --> 02:07.470
not dropping out.

02:07.510 --> 02:08.710
With your grades,

02:08.750 --> 02:09.990
you'll fall even further behind

02:09.990 --> 02:11.570
if you delay another year.

02:11.630 --> 02:12.710
Then I don't want the certificate.

02:12.710 --> 02:14.110
I won't want to work for others in the future anyway.

02:14.110 --> 02:15.690
The certificate will be useless to me.

02:16.000 --> 02:18.170
Okay, I'm done talking to you.

02:18.930 --> 02:20.240
Go home,

02:20.270 --> 02:22.110
have your parents write an application

02:22.190 --> 02:23.230
and sign it.

02:23.340 --> 02:24.450
Then I'll agree.

02:24.510 --> 02:25.240
No, Mr. Xu.

02:25.240 --> 02:26.310
Why are you like this?

02:26.310 --> 02:27.700
I'm responsible for you.

02:29.200 --> 02:30.540
Then give me back my business plan.

02:30.670 --> 02:31.350
Go back to class.

02:31.350 --> 02:31.750
Give it back to me.

02:31.750 --> 02:32.510
One...

02:35.829 --> 02:36.430
Mr. Xu.

02:36.430 --> 02:37.190
What is it?

02:41.829 --> 02:42.550
Sir.

02:42.600 --> 02:43.430
I'm sorry.

02:44.190 --> 02:44.950
What's wrong?

02:45.750 --> 02:47.550
Which student upset you this time?

02:47.590 --> 02:48.720
Xie Wanghe.

02:50.310 --> 02:51.490
Xie Wanghe again?

02:53.960 --> 02:55.480
What did he do this time?

02:55.750 --> 02:58.500
He just told me he wants to drop out.

02:59.030 --> 03:00.190
Can you believe it? He's in his final year of high school.

03:00.190 --> 03:01.420
What's the point of dropping out now?

03:01.470 --> 03:02.760
He even wants to start a business.

03:03.910 --> 03:05.430
What does he want to do?

03:06.190 --> 03:08.750
He wants to open a test prep center.

03:08.790 --> 03:10.330
He says it will definitely make money.

03:10.470 --> 03:12.780
He's even come up with a business plan.

03:13.490 --> 03:19.650
[General Affairs Office]

03:15.620 --> 03:17.400
Wouldn't it be better if he just focused on his studies

03:17.400 --> 03:19.430
instead of always thinking about these ridiculous ideas?

03:19.450 --> 03:20.270
That's more meaningful,

03:20.270 --> 03:21.110
isn't it?

03:21.180 --> 03:22.470
This is kind of interesting.

03:23.470 --> 03:25.740
The idea is actually pretty good.

03:25.770 --> 03:28.420
It's just not the right time, is it?

03:34.470 --> 03:35.710
S-Sir?

03:37.590 --> 03:38.500
Mr. Wu?

03:40.750 --> 03:43.880
This idea is perfect for our school.

03:44.500 --> 03:45.850
We could run it through the school

03:46.270 --> 03:47.660
as a non-profit.

03:48.110 --> 03:50.079
It could potentially improve our college admission rates.

03:50.790 --> 03:51.990
It's a good idea.

03:52.870 --> 03:55.550
Isn't it inappropriate for the school?

03:55.579 --> 03:57.020
What's inappropriate about it?

03:57.050 --> 03:58.350
As educators,

03:58.390 --> 03:59.220
what are we after?

03:59.430 --> 04:02.290
Don't we just want our students to have a bright future?

04:03.020 --> 04:04.830
If this plan really works

04:05.710 --> 04:06.910
and our college admission rate improves,

04:08.270 --> 04:10.590
it's worth the extra effort on our part.

04:10.590 --> 04:11.430
Yes.

04:11.990 --> 04:13.080
Sir, Sir.

04:14.260 --> 04:16.820
This idea is from Xie Wanghe.

04:17.680 --> 04:18.920
Your reminder is timely.

04:18.940 --> 04:21.410
It's great to have students like Xie Wanghe.

04:21.589 --> 04:23.550
Devoting oneself selflessly to the school

04:23.620 --> 04:25.840
and striving tirelessly for progress

04:26.070 --> 04:28.790
is an action worthy of reward.

04:30.580 --> 04:32.420
B-But Sir...

04:32.780 --> 04:35.940
I thank him on behalf of all the teachers and students.

04:44.230 --> 04:46.000
That's what happened.

04:46.570 --> 04:48.210
I've also tried to persuade the principal on your behalf.

04:48.370 --> 04:50.909
The principal said your idea was excellent.

04:50.950 --> 04:53.420
He thanks you on behalf of all the students.

04:53.710 --> 04:55.620
That's not very nice of you guys.

04:55.790 --> 04:57.860
You're no better than bandits for claiming it this way!

04:57.990 --> 04:59.800
You shouldn't think this way.

04:59.870 --> 05:00.910
This idea of yours

05:00.950 --> 05:02.110
was just to make money.

05:02.110 --> 05:03.510
But when the school does it,

05:03.550 --> 05:05.210
it's non-profit in nature.

05:05.390 --> 05:06.710
It's for everyone's benefit.

05:06.790 --> 05:09.330
Besides, if the school's college admission rate improves

05:09.350 --> 05:11.840
and everyone achieves breakthrough with their grades,

05:12.440 --> 05:14.360
doesn't that reflect well on you too?

05:14.390 --> 05:16.350
I don't care about honor. I want money.

05:16.380 --> 05:18.370
Why can't I make you understand?

05:18.390 --> 05:19.830
You're a student now.

05:19.830 --> 05:21.430
You should just focus on your studies.

05:21.430 --> 05:23.510
Don't just think about money all day long.

05:23.550 --> 05:25.390
And this matter is a done deal.

05:31.210 --> 05:32.310
Have a cola.

05:32.330 --> 05:33.880
Consider it as compensation.

05:34.860 --> 05:35.880
Mr. Xu?

05:39.250 --> 05:40.010
Who is it?

05:49.150 --> 05:50.670
What did you talk to Mr. Xu about?

05:52.860 --> 05:54.200
I applied for a leave of absence.

05:54.590 --> 05:55.630
He didn't agree.

05:55.670 --> 05:57.030
He even stole my business plan.

05:57.900 --> 05:58.909
Are you serious?

06:00.110 --> 06:01.590
That's so shameless.

06:03.830 --> 06:04.590
It's okay.

06:05.140 --> 06:06.110
If they insist on doing it,

06:06.130 --> 06:07.230
I can't stop them either.

06:07.550 --> 06:09.600
Fortunately, I have a backup plan.

06:10.110 --> 06:10.830
What plan?

06:12.160 --> 06:13.460
Hello, Mr. Xu.

06:13.480 --> 06:14.160
Hello.

06:17.460 --> 06:18.330
Hello, Mr. Xu.

06:18.400 --> 06:18.910
Hello.

06:21.640 --> 06:23.360
Are you making instant noodles again?

06:23.910 --> 06:24.990
It's convenient, isn't it?

06:47.830 --> 06:49.270
And who did this?

06:49.350 --> 06:50.600
This is too much!

06:50.710 --> 06:52.840
Who did this?

06:54.330 --> 07:00.120
[Online smart question bank startup plan]

06:55.220 --> 06:57.220
Keep it a secret. Don't give it away.

06:58.470 --> 06:59.930
Smart question bank?

07:00.960 --> 07:01.950
What does that mean?

07:03.350 --> 07:05.040
When they run test prep centers,

07:05.500 --> 07:07.010
it's all offline.

07:07.620 --> 07:09.680
I'm doing it online.

07:10.010 --> 07:11.120
I can make a lot of money just as well.

07:11.150 --> 07:12.030
I might even

07:12.040 --> 07:14.450
make more money than they do at school.

07:14.890 --> 07:16.350
How will you make money?

07:16.470 --> 07:17.470
Who's crazy enough?

07:17.500 --> 07:19.300
We can't even finish all the homework assigned by the school.

07:19.330 --> 07:20.760
Who will pay for more exercises online?

07:20.870 --> 07:22.230
You wouldn't understand even if I explained to you.

07:22.690 --> 07:24.780
If I don't understand, then explain it to me clearly.

07:24.910 --> 07:25.990
Don't end up spending all that time and effort

07:26.030 --> 07:27.550
only to accomplish nothing and lose money.

07:28.270 --> 07:29.590
Why would I lose money?

07:31.750 --> 07:33.670
As long as people still want to get into college,

07:34.030 --> 07:35.030
this question bank

07:35.110 --> 07:36.550
will be the best choice.

07:37.150 --> 07:38.550
The question bank will have a massive collection of questions.

07:38.580 --> 07:39.909
Every time you practice,

07:40.140 --> 07:41.790
it will analyze your answers

07:41.830 --> 07:43.909
to identify your weaknesses

07:43.930 --> 07:46.220
and tweak the next set of questions accordingly.

07:46.240 --> 07:47.560
This is called progressive training.

07:48.850 --> 07:49.970
To put it simply,

07:50.000 --> 07:52.510
it's like an online tutor.

07:53.080 --> 07:55.070
This is what I call foresight

07:55.250 --> 07:56.350
and a vision for the future.

07:57.110 --> 07:57.790
Yeah, right. Keep talking.

07:58.030 --> 07:58.980
Can you really make it happen?

08:01.350 --> 08:03.460
How will we know if we don't try?

08:05.410 --> 08:07.320
The college entrance exam's market is huge.

08:08.000 --> 08:09.560
As long as I set my goal

08:09.960 --> 08:11.280
and press on with determination,

08:11.700 --> 08:12.710
I'm sure I can succeed.

08:13.150 --> 08:14.680
Once I've arranged my leave of absence,

08:15.020 --> 08:16.620
I'll head straight to Beijing.

08:18.630 --> 08:19.390
Wait.

08:19.630 --> 08:21.150
Are you really taking a leave of absence?

08:21.170 --> 08:22.630
Will your parents agree?

08:23.050 --> 08:23.930
I can only try.

08:24.500 --> 08:26.530
I have a complete business plan.

08:26.620 --> 08:28.700
I think I can convince my mom.

08:30.380 --> 08:32.490
Can you not take a break from school just yet?

08:32.510 --> 08:34.110
If you need money, you can borrow from me.

08:38.230 --> 08:38.830
Fine.

08:38.830 --> 08:40.549
You really think you're a commercial star now, huh?

08:40.590 --> 08:42.030
That company must be blind

08:42.030 --> 08:43.150
to hire you as a model.

08:43.409 --> 08:45.150
At least I have more money than you now.

08:45.150 --> 08:46.350
Fine, fine.

08:46.350 --> 08:47.770
You're something, okay?

08:48.650 --> 08:50.190
I'm being serious.

08:50.220 --> 08:52.310
There's only a year left, so just hang in there.

08:52.350 --> 08:54.630
You can still start your business after you graduate.

08:54.690 --> 08:57.130
I now earn several thousands a month.

08:58.040 --> 08:59.140
What's yours is yours.

08:59.140 --> 09:00.550
I can't be spending your money.

09:00.870 --> 09:01.820
Why not?

09:02.030 --> 09:03.480
I've spent your money before too.

09:04.470 --> 09:05.300
When?

09:05.580 --> 09:06.470
When we were kids.

09:07.750 --> 09:09.110
When we go out to buy snacks and stuff,

09:09.150 --> 09:10.350
weren't you always the one paying?

09:10.350 --> 09:11.510
I don’t even know

09:11.550 --> 09:13.320
how many pencil cases you’ve gotten me.

09:13.360 --> 09:14.830
I haven't spent any money for you yet.

09:14.850 --> 09:15.800
No need.

09:17.520 --> 09:18.590
For the next two years,

09:18.590 --> 09:19.990
just focus on your commercials.

09:20.010 --> 09:21.300
Save up the money

09:21.750 --> 09:23.400
because it's unlikely you will get into a university.

09:23.420 --> 09:25.260
When I head north to start my own business,

09:25.660 --> 09:28.050
you can use that money to invest in my company.

09:28.380 --> 09:29.620
I'll lead you to riches.

09:29.650 --> 09:30.650
In the future,

09:30.680 --> 09:32.180
you'll be President Xia.

09:34.060 --> 09:34.880
Okay.

09:35.050 --> 09:36.530
That's your own words.

09:36.550 --> 09:37.600
No backing out.

09:38.390 --> 09:39.390
I said it.

09:39.390 --> 09:40.310
I won't back out.

10:10.260 --> 10:11.340
Chen Rui.

10:19.750 --> 10:21.820
These are the notes I've taken recently.

10:22.350 --> 10:23.390
Hurry up and copy them.

10:23.590 --> 10:24.730
Ask me if there's anything you don't understand.

10:46.460 --> 10:48.860
Please don't take offense

10:49.110 --> 10:50.760
at the nonsense my mother

10:50.840 --> 10:51.990
said to you last week.

10:58.120 --> 10:59.390
She's just...

10:59.590 --> 11:01.460
very straightforward when she speaks.

11:01.580 --> 11:03.530
She actually doesn't mean any harm.

11:06.150 --> 11:07.330
She's just...

11:07.370 --> 11:09.750
I wouldn't be here if I really minded.

11:24.630 --> 11:25.660
Here, everyone.

11:25.750 --> 11:26.870
The noodles are ready.

11:34.350 --> 11:35.110
Wanghe.

11:36.570 --> 11:38.350
We can definitely build this website.

11:38.750 --> 11:39.630
However...

11:40.070 --> 11:42.920
Wouldn't we need substantial upfront investment?

11:43.310 --> 11:44.350
It's not too bad.

11:44.480 --> 11:45.770
We just need a computer

11:45.930 --> 11:47.220
with decent specifications.

11:47.670 --> 11:49.470
We can't keep going to internet cafés to get work done.

11:49.510 --> 11:50.430
That's too passive.

11:53.530 --> 11:54.590
[Industrial and Commercial Bank of China]

11:53.640 --> 11:54.590
Let's buy it.

11:56.790 --> 11:57.710
Where did you get the money from?

11:58.470 --> 12:00.010
I sold my gaming account.

12:00.230 --> 12:00.880
There's 10,000 yuan.

12:01.230 --> 12:02.110
We’ll talk if it’s not enough.

12:12.360 --> 12:13.040
Then let's do this.

12:13.670 --> 12:15.350
Once we make money,

12:15.610 --> 12:17.090
we'll first return 10,000 yuan to you.

12:17.660 --> 12:18.500
Then we'll give it to Siyi.

12:18.610 --> 12:19.590
You should give it to Siyi first.

12:19.590 --> 12:20.710
I'm not in a hurry to use the money.

12:20.710 --> 12:21.510
That won't do.

12:22.110 --> 12:24.120
This counts as angel investment.

12:24.810 --> 12:27.120
I'm sure we'll be working together for years to come.

12:27.470 --> 12:29.190
So, we must to set the rules straight first.

12:29.320 --> 12:30.230
Even brothers

12:30.350 --> 12:31.240
settle accounts clearly.

12:31.350 --> 12:33.160
Let's try to be as fair as possible.

12:33.320 --> 12:33.990
Otherwise,

12:33.990 --> 12:35.310
this brotherhood won't last.

12:35.610 --> 12:36.680
I won't accept

12:36.900 --> 12:37.830
this investment either.

12:37.560 --> 12:38.470
[Industrial and Commercial Bank of China]

12:43.940 --> 12:44.990
Alright, I agree.

12:45.000 --> 12:46.640
Let's keep clear accounts even as brothers.

12:46.940 --> 12:47.620
That's good.

12:48.860 --> 12:49.750
We'll do as you say.

12:50.820 --> 12:51.340
Alright.

12:54.190 --> 12:55.790
Now that everything is ready,

12:55.970 --> 12:57.400
we just need an office.

12:58.990 --> 13:00.310
There's one available,

13:01.150 --> 13:02.030
and it's free.

13:02.060 --> 13:02.630
Where?

13:04.770 --> 13:06.280
Hurry up, you two! Come on!

13:06.320 --> 13:07.080
Coming, coming!

13:07.230 --> 13:08.520
Don't rush, don't rush.

13:21.050 --> 13:21.740
Not bad,

13:21.740 --> 13:22.810
Xingchi.

13:23.030 --> 13:24.030
This is a great idea.

13:38.740 --> 13:39.500
Alright.

13:41.310 --> 13:42.690
I announce that

13:43.430 --> 13:46.030
the online smart question bank startup

13:46.290 --> 13:47.910
is officially launched.

13:53.030 --> 13:54.110
Let me tell you.

13:54.840 --> 13:56.330
Back then, Steve Jobs

13:56.370 --> 13:57.610
and Bill Gates

13:57.630 --> 13:59.580
started their businesses in garages.

13:59.610 --> 14:01.990
Today, we're starting in a ship's cabin.

14:02.390 --> 14:04.320
So we're bound to succeed.

14:04.700 --> 14:05.220
Right.

14:05.380 --> 14:06.190
We'll definitely make it.

14:06.190 --> 14:07.230
We're going to make big money!

14:07.270 --> 14:09.530
Fortune 500 is just around the corner.

14:10.890 --> 14:11.710
So,

14:11.730 --> 14:13.010
once we create this smart question bank,

14:13.040 --> 14:13.720
who are we selling it to?

14:13.950 --> 14:15.340
Sell it to No. 7 High School.

14:15.410 --> 14:16.690
No, sell it to No. 1 High School.

14:16.740 --> 14:18.040
Let's annoy our principal.

14:18.430 --> 14:19.630
That's for stealing our plan.

14:19.700 --> 14:20.270
Don't be like that.

14:20.310 --> 14:21.670
You are still too narrow-minded.

14:21.870 --> 14:23.230
Come on, let's talk business.

14:25.060 --> 14:26.260
I've already

14:26.300 --> 14:27.610
bought a train ticket.

14:28.580 --> 14:30.010
I'm going to Beijing.

14:31.650 --> 14:32.700
You're really going?

14:33.860 --> 14:34.670
Firstly,

14:35.090 --> 14:36.930
we need to rent a server.

14:36.960 --> 14:37.510
Secondly,

14:37.710 --> 14:38.990
I need to visit Zhongguancun

14:38.990 --> 14:40.310
to see what it's like over there.

14:40.530 --> 14:43.450
After all, Beijing is the center of the country’s internet industry.

14:43.850 --> 14:46.070
If I happen to run into some internet bigwig,

14:46.230 --> 14:47.590
I'm confident I can persuade them

14:47.620 --> 14:48.870
to support our startup.

14:50.460 --> 14:52.380
The idea is great,

14:52.750 --> 14:54.310
but isn't it a bit hasty

14:54.350 --> 14:55.350
to go to Beijing now?

14:55.350 --> 14:56.060
That's right.

14:56.230 --> 14:57.840
So when do you think we should go?

14:58.110 --> 14:58.790
After the college entrance exam?

14:59.870 --> 15:01.670
We definitely need to take the college entrance exam.

15:01.720 --> 15:03.710
Otherwise, your high school years would have been wasted.

15:03.870 --> 15:04.750
Forget it.

15:04.960 --> 15:06.910
You two might still do well if you push yourselves.

15:07.230 --> 15:08.780
Does it even matter if I take the exam?

15:09.350 --> 15:10.430
I will just make a fool of myself.

15:16.970 --> 15:18.120
When we are in Beijing,

15:18.120 --> 15:20.470
we must go to the best

15:20.520 --> 15:21.620
office buildings

15:22.320 --> 15:23.710
and rent a big office.

15:23.710 --> 15:24.720
You two will each have your own room.

15:24.790 --> 15:26.270
That's your own words.

15:26.270 --> 15:28.310
Thank you Mr. Xie in advance.

15:31.930 --> 15:32.540
Dad.

15:34.590 --> 15:35.390
Uncle.

15:37.700 --> 15:38.940
Why are you back so late?

15:39.590 --> 15:41.200
You're already a senior.

15:42.150 --> 15:43.760
Can't you take it more seriously?

15:45.230 --> 15:46.350
Just because others aren't planning to take the exam,

15:46.350 --> 15:48.150
does that mean you're not planning to either?

15:48.450 --> 15:50.620
Or have you already decided to give up?

15:56.360 --> 15:57.560
Wanghe, please stay.

16:02.400 --> 16:03.150
In the future,

16:03.980 --> 16:06.140
could you stop dragging him along with you?

16:06.180 --> 16:06.910
Dad!

16:07.280 --> 16:09.010
Can you not be so selfish when you speak?

16:09.030 --> 16:10.910
I want you to study hard.

16:10.950 --> 16:13.080
I want you to get into a top university.

16:13.190 --> 16:14.590
I'm doing this for your own good.

16:14.590 --> 16:15.190
I don't need it!

16:15.190 --> 16:15.630
You...

16:15.710 --> 16:16.340
Uncle! Uncle!

16:16.340 --> 16:18.190
Uncle, Uncle!

16:19.050 --> 16:19.850
Don't worry,

16:20.830 --> 16:23.200
I won't interfere with Xingchi's studies in the future.

16:23.870 --> 16:24.810
And Haikuo,

16:24.870 --> 16:25.810
you too.

16:26.100 --> 16:27.050
Both of you study hard

16:27.080 --> 16:27.720
and do well in your exams.

16:27.830 --> 16:28.790
As for my affairs,

16:29.000 --> 16:30.140
you two don't need to worry about them.

16:32.280 --> 16:32.990
Uncle,

16:36.870 --> 16:37.630
I'm sorry.

16:49.680 --> 16:50.450
Let's go home.

16:54.840 --> 16:56.460
Make sure to talk to your dad nicely.

17:35.590 --> 17:37.120
When are you shooting the commercial?

17:38.500 --> 17:39.230
This weekend.

17:39.870 --> 17:40.830
I'm going to the city for the shoot.

17:40.990 --> 17:43.190
The studio is quite impressive.

17:44.520 --> 17:45.680
Do you need me to accompany you?

17:46.680 --> 17:47.390
No.

17:47.800 --> 17:49.050
If you are watching from the sidelines,

17:49.080 --> 17:49.980
I'll feel uncomfortable.

17:50.000 --> 17:50.820
Why?

17:51.590 --> 17:52.830
Would you be comfortable

17:52.830 --> 17:54.450
having others watch you pose and preen?

17:56.230 --> 17:57.900
They'll see it sooner or later.

17:58.230 --> 17:59.480
This ugly daughter-in-law

18:00.500 --> 18:01.870
will have to meet the in-laws eventually.

18:02.590 --> 18:04.310
Well, when I become famous,

18:04.310 --> 18:06.190
I'll print out my photos

18:06.190 --> 18:07.430
and plaster them all over your room.

18:07.470 --> 18:08.190
Fine.

18:08.590 --> 18:10.240
Better print them in black and white.

18:10.280 --> 18:11.310
I'll light two incense sticks for you,

18:11.350 --> 18:11.990
lay out a couple of apples,

18:12.010 --> 18:13.050
and set up a shrine for you.

18:14.310 --> 18:16.270
Can you not keep running your mouth?

18:21.950 --> 18:22.710
Fenghua.

18:23.640 --> 18:25.470
Am I really that annoying?

18:26.400 --> 18:27.820
Oh, so you're aware.

18:35.370 --> 18:36.210
It's okay.

18:36.610 --> 18:37.500
Don't put yourself down.

18:38.100 --> 18:39.210
I'm not annoyed by you.

18:39.380 --> 18:40.650
I cherish you, alright?

18:41.710 --> 18:43.160
Could you be any more perfunctory?

18:57.390 --> 18:58.310
Xie Wanghe,

18:59.470 --> 19:00.550
I cherish you.

19:19.200 --> 19:21.730
W-what terrible acting!

19:22.670 --> 19:24.820
All those idol dramas you watched were for nothing.

19:24.870 --> 19:25.710
If you ever like someone in the future,

19:25.710 --> 19:26.990
please don’t behave like this.

19:26.990 --> 19:28.270
You might scare them to death.

19:32.020 --> 19:33.550
You're about to become a star,

19:33.550 --> 19:35.070
so can't you be a bit more ladylike?

19:35.150 --> 19:36.030
I won't.

19:36.030 --> 19:37.070
I just won't.

19:41.970 --> 19:42.600
Here.

19:48.960 --> 19:50.820
Come closer, the wire isn't long enough.

19:51.360 --> 19:55.130
♫Maybe if I wait, you'll come back♫

19:55.950 --> 19:59.280
♫What will you do without me♫

19:59.830 --> 20:03.520
♫Who will dry your tears?♫

20:03.930 --> 20:07.390
♫Who will hold up an umbrella and comfort you♫

20:08.330 --> 20:12.360
♫You're afraid of loneliness on a sleepless night♫

20:13.220 --> 20:16.720
♫What will you do without me♫

20:17.340 --> 20:20.500
♫Who else knows what's on your mind?♫

20:19.230 --> 20:20.770
This school sports meet

20:20.990 --> 20:22.590
aims to exercise our bodies

20:21.340 --> 20:23.960
♫Why did you let go of me and leave♫

20:22.750 --> 20:24.590
and improve our physical fitness.

20:24.930 --> 20:26.820
We will learn the Olympic values of being higher,

20:26.940 --> 20:28.720
[Campus Sports Day]

20:27.140 --> 20:28.220
faster,

20:28.440 --> 20:30.550
and stronger.

20:30.740 --> 20:32.300
For today's sports meet,

20:32.710 --> 20:34.400
I still say the same thing.

20:34.950 --> 20:36.190
Competition comes first,

20:36.350 --> 20:37.510
friendship second.

20:39.080 --> 20:40.190
Sir!

20:40.230 --> 20:40.990
Competition first,

20:40.990 --> 20:42.280
friendship second.

20:42.380 --> 20:43.500
Friendship first,

20:43.500 --> 20:44.580
competition second.

20:44.830 --> 20:46.590
Alright, stop laughing everyone.

20:47.310 --> 20:48.670
This sports meet is

20:48.710 --> 20:51.740
specially sponsored by Dingsheng Group of Honghuai City.

20:51.930 --> 20:53.140
Dingsheng, Dingsheng,

20:53.180 --> 20:54.640
the mightiest in Honghuai!

20:54.800 --> 20:56.800
What on earth is this?

20:57.390 --> 20:58.370
What are you saying?

20:59.280 --> 21:00.460
Your family sponsored it?

21:00.490 --> 21:01.470
Obviously.

21:01.590 --> 21:02.590
All the competition equipment,

21:02.590 --> 21:04.150
prizes, and broadcasting equipment

21:04.180 --> 21:05.350
were paid for by my dad.

21:05.510 --> 21:07.250
Your dad has money to sponsor,

21:07.280 --> 21:08.970
but none to pay for the transportation fees?

21:09.190 --> 21:11.050
How can your dad be so shameless?

21:11.080 --> 21:12.070
Say that again.

21:12.070 --> 21:13.440
I said your dad is shameless.

21:13.500 --> 21:14.270
I dare you to say that again!

21:14.270 --> 21:16.100
What's wrong with saying your dad is shameless?

21:16.970 --> 21:17.950
Xie Wanghe!

21:19.220 --> 21:20.350
What are you doing?

21:20.600 --> 21:21.480
Sir!

21:21.510 --> 21:23.270
We're just fostering our friendship.

21:23.720 --> 21:24.640
Get back in line!

21:25.750 --> 21:27.060
Now, I announce that

21:27.790 --> 21:29.200
the 2007

21:29.220 --> 21:30.540
Honghuai No. 7 High School's

21:30.170 --> 21:31.850
[Campus Sports Day]

21:30.590 --> 21:33.400
Autumn Sports Meet officially begins!

21:34.960 --> 21:36.050
[Campus Sports Day]

21:41.150 --> 21:42.050
Siyi!

21:42.150 --> 21:43.120
Step here and

21:43.150 --> 21:44.190
flip yourself over.

21:49.520 --> 21:51.000
Hurry up and change.

21:51.040 --> 21:51.970
Listen,

21:52.030 --> 21:53.020
it's about to start.

21:53.030 --> 21:54.240
Drink plenty of water later.

21:54.320 --> 21:56.000
Be careful not to strain your voice from shouting.

21:58.670 --> 22:00.400
Athletes on the track,

22:00.430 --> 22:01.750
every step you take

22:01.750 --> 22:04.150
echoes the melody of youth.

22:04.190 --> 22:05.430
Every sprint

22:05.430 --> 22:07.390
shines with the light of perseverance.

22:07.390 --> 22:07.910
How's that?

22:07.990 --> 22:09.700
Press on! For your dreams,

22:09.700 --> 22:10.990
for glory,

22:10.990 --> 22:12.030
sprint ahead!

22:12.030 --> 22:12.870
This is our No. 7 High School's sports meet.

22:12.870 --> 22:14.170
What is she doing here as a student from No.1?

22:14.190 --> 22:15.670
I'm warning you, don't be a jerk.

22:16.090 --> 22:17.490
She's wearing our school uniform too.

22:17.520 --> 22:18.830
Look at how clever you think you are.

22:18.860 --> 22:20.250
Mr. Xu!

22:20.420 --> 22:22.310
Sun Sanliang, you have a death wish, don't you?

22:22.330 --> 22:22.710
Ouch, ouch!

22:22.710 --> 22:23.430
What now?

22:23.450 --> 22:24.180
It hurts!

22:24.540 --> 22:26.560
Same old problem. He's asking for a beating.

22:27.030 --> 22:28.100
It's our No. 7 High School's sports meet.

22:28.140 --> 22:29.030
What is she doing here?

22:29.030 --> 22:30.070
Get lost!

22:30.100 --> 22:31.330
You're asking for it, aren't you?

22:32.220 --> 22:32.870
Back off!

22:32.890 --> 22:34.150
The principal already said

22:34.150 --> 22:35.550
fighting is strictly prohibited on the field,

22:35.570 --> 22:36.650
or there will be severe punishment.

22:36.680 --> 22:37.560
Scared now, huh?

22:38.400 --> 22:39.310
Xie Wanghe,

22:39.710 --> 22:41.270
Our classes are in the same group for the 4x100 relay.

22:41.330 --> 22:43.230
Let's settle our scores on the track.

22:43.260 --> 22:44.310
Whoever loses

22:44.330 --> 22:45.780
has to remove their bicycle seat

22:45.810 --> 22:46.940
and ride home in public.

22:46.960 --> 22:47.870
Alright,

22:47.990 --> 22:48.840
you said it.

22:48.870 --> 22:49.470
It's a deal!

22:49.510 --> 22:49.920
Okay.

22:49.940 --> 22:51.210
What's going on, what's going on?

22:51.360 --> 22:52.580
What's happening here?

22:52.610 --> 22:53.410
What are you two doing?

22:53.460 --> 22:54.710
Every time you get together, there's trouble.

22:54.790 --> 22:55.500
Alright.

22:55.550 --> 22:56.470
Break it up, break it up.

22:56.520 --> 22:57.470
Break it up!

22:57.580 --> 22:58.340
Stop messing around.

22:59.390 --> 23:00.920
Xia Fenghua, I've been looking all over for you.

23:00.950 --> 23:02.710
The shot put competition is about to start.

23:02.710 --> 23:04.140
Our class is counting on you.

23:04.160 --> 23:04.920
Quick, come.

23:06.190 --> 23:06.990
Let's go.

23:08.240 --> 23:09.660
Dude,

23:09.950 --> 23:11.200
stop being so nasty with your mouth.

23:13.030 --> 23:14.710
In front of the long jump pit,

23:14.710 --> 23:16.590
all of you are poised and ready.

23:17.200 --> 23:18.930
Fenghua's competition starts at the same time.

23:18.970 --> 23:19.890
Which one will you watch first?

23:20.220 --> 23:21.820
Every jump

23:21.840 --> 23:24.080
is a leap beyond your own limits.

23:24.500 --> 23:26.120
All the best, Fenghua!

23:26.150 --> 23:27.230
It's up to you now.

23:28.540 --> 23:29.700
These shoes are great.

23:29.790 --> 23:31.690
One, two, three, let's go!

23:32.720 --> 23:33.790
Be gentle.

23:33.790 --> 23:34.430
You can do it.

23:34.430 --> 23:36.370
My hands will be weak soon.

23:37.180 --> 23:38.790
Don't underestimate us just because we're small.

23:38.790 --> 23:40.100
We might not lose.

23:44.990 --> 23:46.070
Xingchi, Xingchi!

23:46.090 --> 23:47.420
Don't feel pressured.

23:47.460 --> 23:48.970
It all depends on you as the first leg.

23:49.070 --> 23:50.030
Why are you looking at me?

23:50.030 --> 23:51.540
Look ahead and focus.

23:51.570 --> 23:52.250
Come on!

23:52.960 --> 23:53.520
Come on!

23:53.550 --> 23:54.420
Come on, Fenghua!

23:54.550 --> 23:55.350
Come on, Fenghua!

23:55.390 --> 23:57.030
Come on! Come on!

23:57.030 --> 23:58.050
Come on, Fenghua!

23:58.930 --> 23:59.810
Run!

24:00.000 --> 24:01.590
The 100-meter sprint

24:01.630 --> 24:04.070
skims the track like lightning.

24:04.200 --> 24:06.940
It's the ultimate pursuit of speed.

24:07.550 --> 24:08.870
Athletes,

24:08.870 --> 24:12.110
write your legend with your legs.

24:09.990 --> 24:13.850
♫Keep running♫

24:12.550 --> 24:13.390
Xingchi!

24:13.430 --> 24:14.200
Faster!

24:14.310 --> 24:17.640
♫Keep running♫

24:17.470 --> 24:21.680
Go! Go!

24:19.070 --> 24:20.640
♫Time gently chases on♫

24:21.280 --> 24:23.470
♫I'll never regret♫

24:21.900 --> 24:22.700
Wanghe!

24:22.760 --> 24:23.520
Go for it!

24:23.860 --> 24:26.340
♫Our prideful youth♫

24:25.170 --> 24:26.320
Haikuo, faster!

24:26.430 --> 24:27.710
Haikuo, move it!

24:27.200 --> 24:29.660
♫Nothing else mattered♫

24:28.190 --> 24:29.070
Come on

24:30.110 --> 24:31.870
♫Let the world chase us slowly♫

24:30.300 --> 24:31.050
Come on

24:32.510 --> 24:34.620
♫I don't want to regret♫

24:35.220 --> 24:37.470
♫The pride among the stars♫

24:38.460 --> 24:41.150
♫Keep running♫

24:39.870 --> 24:41.320
Fighting

24:41.320 --> 24:43.040
Wanghe, come on!

24:41.890 --> 24:45.500
♫Keep running♫

24:43.130 --> 24:44.120
Go!

24:44.150 --> 24:47.410
Wanghe, come on! Wanghe, come on!

24:50.630 --> 24:51.720
Come on!

24:51.720 --> 24:53.430
Good! Good!

24:52.210 --> 24:54.980
♫Keep running♫

24:55.660 --> 24:58.600
♫Keep running♫

24:57.030 --> 24:57.830
Come on!

25:01.190 --> 25:02.720
Xie Wanghe has fallen!

25:02.720 --> 25:04.790
Sun Sanliang bursts through the finishing line.

25:04.790 --> 25:07.760
Class Four has won first place in this competition.

25:07.850 --> 25:08.610
Are you okay?

25:09.430 --> 25:10.800
What's going on here?

25:11.450 --> 25:12.440
Are you okay?

25:12.550 --> 25:13.430
Are you all right?

25:13.450 --> 25:14.750
It's all because of these damn shoes.

25:14.750 --> 25:15.520
No,

25:15.550 --> 25:16.740
don't just throw them away.

25:18.090 --> 25:19.280
Do you admit defeat?

25:19.470 --> 25:21.100
You can't win, so you are blaming your shoes, right?

25:23.270 --> 25:24.240
Say that again?

25:24.860 --> 25:25.720
Xia Fenghua!

25:25.900 --> 25:26.860
Xia Fenghua!

25:26.890 --> 25:28.170
Come back, come back.

25:28.700 --> 25:30.140
What are you doing?

25:30.170 --> 25:32.050
It's a matter of fact that we lost.

25:32.330 --> 25:33.890
Let's not go looking for trouble.

25:33.910 --> 25:35.270
We need to stay calm and composed.

25:35.310 --> 25:38.040
The women's javelin is about to begin.

25:38.100 --> 25:39.830
All athletes, please take your positions immediately.

25:39.830 --> 25:40.630
Xia Fenghua.

25:40.650 --> 25:42.130
It's all up to you this time.

25:42.860 --> 25:43.430
Fenghua.

25:43.450 --> 25:44.170
Be careful.

25:44.200 --> 25:45.390
That thing is sharp.

25:45.420 --> 25:46.190
It's up to me again?

25:46.190 --> 25:47.130
You good?

25:47.390 --> 25:49.160
You don't usually have such high hopes for me.

25:49.180 --> 25:49.710
It's not that.

25:49.950 --> 25:52.270
Our class should at least have one good result, right?

25:52.290 --> 25:53.930
We don't even have a single first place yet.

25:53.960 --> 25:55.820
I was counting on them...

26:02.210 --> 26:03.710
Alright, stop laughing!

26:05.590 --> 26:07.060
Go for it, Fenghua!

26:07.440 --> 26:08.820
Come on, Fenghua!

26:08.860 --> 26:09.750
Go for it!

26:09.990 --> 26:10.720
Move aside!

26:10.720 --> 26:11.640
Come on!

26:13.390 --> 26:14.240
Stop looking.

26:14.240 --> 26:15.320
Let's go.

26:16.130 --> 26:19.100
They all deserve our highest respect.

26:20.270 --> 26:21.430
Shoes, shoes, shoes!

26:23.180 --> 26:24.800
Hold on to me, I can't see.

26:26.470 --> 26:29.240
Now, a lost and found announcement.

26:29.300 --> 26:29.940
Blargh!

26:29.980 --> 26:33.010
A student has lost a set of keys on the field.

26:34.380 --> 26:35.450
Hurry up.

26:35.480 --> 26:37.020
Rinse it off for me.

26:37.040 --> 26:38.180
Rinse his head.

26:39.950 --> 26:40.910
Slow down.

26:40.940 --> 26:41.990
Have a rinse.

26:42.010 --> 26:42.920
Water's cold!

27:09.870 --> 27:11.820
Take good shots and I'll treat you to dinner tonight.

27:12.240 --> 27:14.210
They dropped the ball at the crucial moment.

27:14.470 --> 27:16.490
When will those three ever give me a break?

27:16.850 --> 27:18.840
Why are you counting on me instead?

27:18.860 --> 27:20.820
Of course I'm counting on you.

27:20.840 --> 27:21.910
Xia Fenghua.

27:22.050 --> 27:24.310
I know you're the type who stays quiet

27:24.390 --> 27:25.740
until you're ready to make a big impact.

27:25.740 --> 27:26.830
Our class is relying on you,

27:26.860 --> 27:28.140
so do your best!

27:29.370 --> 27:30.770
Don't be discouraged, Fenghua.

27:30.800 --> 27:32.090
You may have lost in shot put,

27:32.120 --> 27:33.110
but there's still javelin.

27:33.150 --> 27:34.510
I'm not bragging,

27:34.750 --> 27:37.390
but javelin isn't about strength,

27:37.430 --> 27:39.320
it's about flexibility and coordination.

27:41.720 --> 27:43.020
Aren't you in Go Club?

27:43.020 --> 27:44.420
Go is just my hobby.

27:44.510 --> 27:45.710
My mom was on the provincial track and field team.

27:45.710 --> 27:47.050
I practiced every day when I was little.

27:48.150 --> 27:49.870
On the 100-meter track,

27:49.910 --> 27:52.550
you expressed youth through speed.

27:52.670 --> 27:55.620
You ignited hope with passion.

27:55.990 --> 27:59.550
Go for it! Let the wind cheer you on.

27:59.670 --> 28:02.470
Let your hearts applaud for you.

28:02.710 --> 28:03.790
Come on, Fenghua!

28:10.480 --> 28:11.510
Who's that?

28:12.690 --> 28:14.290
What's happening here?

28:25.190 --> 28:25.820
Don't look, don't look!

28:25.820 --> 28:26.780
Don't look, don't look!

28:26.800 --> 28:28.210
Who is playing it?

28:28.870 --> 28:29.710
Who is playing it?

28:29.710 --> 28:30.550
Turn it off!

28:31.690 --> 28:32.770
Stop watching!

28:33.230 --> 28:35.690
Stop the broadcast immediately and turn it off!

28:36.200 --> 28:38.600
Is anyone there? Unplug it!

28:44.940 --> 28:46.220
Still showering?

28:46.890 --> 28:47.920
Having fun?

28:47.960 --> 28:49.360
Are you out of your minds?

28:49.470 --> 28:50.990
You're the one who's out of your mind.

28:51.060 --> 28:52.260
Peeping at boys showering.

28:52.390 --> 28:53.650
Aren't you afraid of getting a sty?

28:53.910 --> 28:55.240
It's being broadcast on the big screen.

28:55.260 --> 28:56.940
The whole school is watching you!

29:08.940 --> 29:11.300
-Who did it?
-Who did it?

29:13.090 --> 29:14.410
Naked Pig Warriors.

29:14.430 --> 29:15.320
Naked pig.

29:15.340 --> 29:16.590
Naked pigs!

29:16.620 --> 29:19.250
I'll keep it for now and return it to you tomorrow.

29:19.740 --> 29:21.680
You know, I'm quite envious of you.

29:21.750 --> 29:22.750
What do you mean?

29:22.750 --> 29:23.730
What's there to envy?

29:24.860 --> 29:26.520
You have such a good friend who treats you so well.

29:26.550 --> 29:28.040
It’s all worth it in this lifetime.

29:31.260 --> 29:32.220
It's alright, Fenghua.

29:32.250 --> 29:34.500
If he doesn't want you, I do.

29:36.890 --> 29:38.190
Are you crazy?

29:38.870 --> 29:39.480
Stop right there.

29:39.510 --> 29:40.070
Just kidding.

29:40.070 --> 29:40.890
I said stop!

29:40.920 --> 29:43.340
Liang's idiocy is no exaggeration.

29:43.710 --> 29:45.470
Fenghua may seem loud and easygoing,

29:45.510 --> 29:47.380
but she's actually quite girly deep down.

29:47.680 --> 29:49.050
You should treat her better from now on.

29:51.260 --> 29:52.060
Let's go.

29:52.230 --> 29:53.730
KFC, here we come.

29:54.150 --> 29:55.500
I'm not in the mood to go.

29:56.800 --> 29:58.190
Cut the crap.

29:58.220 --> 29:59.230
You said it yourself.

29:59.230 --> 30:00.070
You promised to treat us after the competition.

30:00.070 --> 30:01.430
Fried chicken and burgers until we're stuffed.

30:01.470 --> 30:02.630
Don't even think about backing out.

30:02.840 --> 30:03.480
Let me.

30:05.460 --> 30:06.610
Let's go!

30:16.030 --> 30:20.620
Walking towards the distance

30:20.720 --> 30:24.420
in a faraway city,

30:24.600 --> 30:29.500
where there's you and me.

30:29.540 --> 30:34.410
The shallow wheel tracks...

30:34.800 --> 30:39.200
Walking towards the distance

30:39.230 --> 30:43.230
in a faraway city...

30:47.890 --> 30:49.450
Are you really not going?

30:50.260 --> 30:52.590
I’m not going. My grandma will never agree.

30:53.580 --> 30:54.460
Let me persuade her.

30:55.580 --> 30:57.210
I've already begged her several times.

30:57.870 --> 30:58.630
Forget it.

30:59.470 --> 31:00.230
If you're really scared,

31:00.270 --> 31:01.710
ask Wanghe and the others to go with you.

31:04.630 --> 31:05.230
No.

31:05.590 --> 31:06.310
He annoys me.

31:06.990 --> 31:07.590
What's wrong?

31:07.920 --> 31:08.920
Did he bother you again?

31:10.310 --> 31:11.150
You should be asking,

31:11.310 --> 31:12.830
when has he not bothered me?

31:14.480 --> 31:15.970
Alright, I'm leaving then.

31:38.100 --> 31:39.310
Didn't you go for a photo shoot?

31:39.310 --> 31:40.310
Why are you back again?

31:42.170 --> 31:42.730
Mom,

31:44.290 --> 31:45.660
can I discuss something with you?

31:45.680 --> 31:46.510
Go ahead.

31:48.770 --> 31:50.870
About that 10,000 yuan...

31:51.070 --> 31:51.620
What about it?

31:52.630 --> 31:53.390
Did you change your mind?

31:54.060 --> 31:55.210
No.

31:56.970 --> 31:58.070
Granny Ma won't let

31:58.070 --> 31:59.470
Siyi model with me.

32:00.430 --> 32:02.430
But if she continues to work as a delivery person,

32:02.430 --> 32:04.430
how long will it take her to earn that money?

32:04.430 --> 32:05.990
It will definitely affect her studies.

32:08.270 --> 32:09.740
So I was thinking,

32:10.380 --> 32:12.780
can I give half of it to Siyi first?

32:12.810 --> 32:13.950
Let her pay it back first.

32:14.290 --> 32:16.760
I'm about to start earning money from commercials anyway.

32:16.860 --> 32:18.320
The gifts for you and Dad...

32:18.470 --> 32:19.630
I can buy it later, right?

32:26.550 --> 32:27.150
No.

32:27.300 --> 32:28.000
Mom,

32:28.240 --> 32:30.230
Siyi's features are much better than mine.

32:30.230 --> 32:32.550
They signed me because of Siyi.

32:35.430 --> 32:37.410
You think your mom is that petty?

32:38.300 --> 32:39.450
It's your money.

32:39.480 --> 32:42.000
You can use it however you want.

32:42.580 --> 32:43.340
Thank you, Mom.

32:54.160 --> 32:55.670
Didn't Wanghe gave me this when I graduated

32:55.670 --> 32:56.750
from elementary school?

32:56.750 --> 32:57.970
You still have it?

32:58.010 --> 33:00.860
"I have to keep all the gifts Wanghe gave me."

33:00.880 --> 33:02.130
If I had thrown it away,

33:02.160 --> 33:03.310
you would have killed me, wouldn't you?

33:04.310 --> 33:05.900
I wouldn't have.

33:09.010 --> 33:10.040
This money,

33:10.540 --> 33:12.070
your dad and I didn't spend it.

33:12.210 --> 33:13.210
We're saving it all for you

33:13.540 --> 33:14.530
as your dowry.

33:14.750 --> 33:15.840
In the future,

33:16.500 --> 33:18.990
along with this little fat piggy,

33:19.220 --> 33:20.100
we'll send it all

33:20.180 --> 33:21.850
to the Xie family with you.

33:24.830 --> 33:25.790
Mom!

33:36.070 --> 33:37.840
Mr. Xu, Mr. Xu!

33:38.680 --> 33:40.240
What are you doing?

33:40.480 --> 33:41.390
Let go of me.

33:41.390 --> 33:42.710
This is my application for a leave of absence.

33:42.740 --> 33:43.810
My parents have already signed it.

33:43.850 --> 33:44.620
Please take a look.

33:45.180 --> 33:47.800
[Parents' signature: Xie Tiancheng, Liang Haihong]

33:48.530 --> 33:50.370
Are you sure your parents signed this?

33:50.390 --> 33:51.470
Of course!

33:51.680 --> 33:54.250
I wouldn't dare make such an important decision on my own.

33:55.700 --> 33:57.630
You still plan on running that test prep center?

33:57.670 --> 33:58.650
I'm not doing that.

33:58.670 --> 34:00.310
Isn't the school running it?

34:01.270 --> 34:02.700
I'll do something else.

34:04.030 --> 34:05.310
What else do you want to do?

34:05.350 --> 34:06.960
It's a secret.

34:08.739 --> 34:10.310
But as soon as it's done,

34:10.330 --> 34:11.889
I'll tell you right away.

34:11.929 --> 34:13.040
Don't worry, it's just for one year.

34:13.060 --> 34:14.770
If it doesn't work out, I'll come right back.

34:14.800 --> 34:16.340
What if you succeed?

34:16.360 --> 34:17.780
I'll come back then too.

34:17.800 --> 34:19.400
No. 7 High School will always be my home.

34:19.420 --> 34:20.550
Mr. Xu's kindness

34:20.590 --> 34:21.480
is higher than the sky

34:21.500 --> 34:22.469
and deeper than the sea.

34:22.489 --> 34:23.949
Mr. Xu.

34:23.969 --> 34:24.900
Go away.

34:24.920 --> 34:26.350
I'd be a fool to believe you.

34:26.370 --> 34:27.929
Mr. Xu, please agree.

34:27.969 --> 34:29.290
My parents have already signed.

34:29.310 --> 34:30.639
-Please agree.
-Let go of me.

34:31.520 --> 34:32.710
Stop pulling me.

34:32.710 --> 34:33.270
Mr. Xu.

34:33.310 --> 34:34.030
Let go of me.

34:34.030 --> 34:35.310
Mr. Xu, I'm begging you.

34:35.310 --> 34:35.790
Please.

34:35.790 --> 34:36.710
Please sign it.

34:36.900 --> 34:38.010
It's crooked, Liangliang.

34:38.030 --> 34:39.030
Straighten it up.

34:39.199 --> 34:39.969
That's right.

34:48.380 --> 34:49.210
Hai.

34:49.420 --> 34:50.280
You're here.

34:50.909 --> 34:52.670
Just you alone? Where's Siyi?

34:52.690 --> 34:54.350
Her grandma didn't agree.

34:54.389 --> 34:55.150
Why?

34:55.940 --> 34:57.620
Maybe she's conservative.

34:57.820 --> 34:59.070
I'll try to persuade her again later.

34:59.390 --> 34:59.830
Alright.

34:59.870 --> 35:00.760
Then we'll shoot you first.

35:01.380 --> 35:03.060
We'll shoot some women's clothing today.

35:03.990 --> 35:05.990
I'll pick out an outfit for you.

35:07.240 --> 35:08.460
Here, this one.

35:12.970 --> 35:14.290
Okay, go get your makeup done.

35:17.720 --> 35:18.550
Don't move.

35:18.570 --> 35:19.430
Yes.

35:19.650 --> 35:21.250
You've never curled your eyelashes before?

35:21.930 --> 35:23.010
No.

35:23.470 --> 35:26.680
The only time was when I secretly used my neighbor's lipstick as a kid.

35:26.700 --> 35:27.630
Neighbor?

35:28.990 --> 35:30.420
My mom doesn't wear makeup.

35:31.150 --> 35:32.380
I have a neighbor.

35:32.390 --> 35:33.400
She's an actress.

35:33.590 --> 35:34.620
She loves...

35:34.650 --> 35:35.350
She loves wearing makeup.

35:35.460 --> 35:36.310
Don't move.

35:36.470 --> 35:37.650
What kind of shows has she been in?

35:38.900 --> 35:39.810
I don't know.

35:39.830 --> 35:41.150
I'll ask her next time.

35:41.160 --> 35:41.710
Okay.

36:02.900 --> 36:04.480
How is it? Does it look good?

36:11.430 --> 36:12.350
Yes, it does.

36:13.270 --> 36:14.560
It looks amazing.

36:19.270 --> 36:20.590
But it feels like...

36:20.770 --> 36:22.200
I'm not myself anymore.

36:22.230 --> 36:24.100
If it’s not you, then who else could it be?

36:28.560 --> 36:29.950
How long will this makeup last?

36:29.990 --> 36:31.530
If you don't wash it off, it'll stay on.

36:32.230 --> 36:33.050
Okay.

36:33.090 --> 36:34.020
Then I won't wash it off.

36:34.040 --> 36:34.760
I'll keep on it for a month.

36:34.790 --> 36:35.640
Alright.

36:37.200 --> 36:41.500
It makes me happier.

36:41.540 --> 36:42.220
Does that sound good?

36:42.240 --> 36:42.800
It sounds good.

36:42.830 --> 36:43.590
Ready?

36:43.900 --> 36:45.060
I'm coming!

36:45.640 --> 36:46.510
Not bad.

36:46.530 --> 36:47.530
You're getting better.

36:47.560 --> 36:48.880
That's great.

36:48.910 --> 36:49.850
Very nice.

37:08.700 --> 37:10.040
Good.

37:10.060 --> 37:10.990
That's a wrap.

37:12.190 --> 37:13.490
So fast?

37:14.730 --> 37:16.560
Let's go with this set, shall we?

37:16.580 --> 37:18.490
I can't find a single flaw.

37:18.530 --> 37:20.120
It's really good.

37:20.220 --> 37:21.620
You look pure and innocent

37:21.650 --> 37:22.890
with a touch of rebellion.

37:23.990 --> 37:24.630
Right.

37:24.630 --> 37:26.670
There's a sneaker advertisement tomorrow.

37:26.690 --> 37:27.890
I've decided to use you.

37:28.370 --> 37:29.020
Alright?

37:29.140 --> 37:30.310
Don't leave tonight.

37:30.310 --> 37:31.030
Just stay here.

37:31.030 --> 37:31.910
There are rooms available here.

37:31.910 --> 37:32.730
I'll have them prepare one for you.

37:32.760 --> 37:33.760
You can go back tomorrow.

37:35.570 --> 37:37.270
I should probably just go back.

37:37.290 --> 37:38.660
Otherwise, my mom will worry.

37:38.690 --> 37:39.530
Look,

37:39.590 --> 37:40.270
the journey

37:40.270 --> 37:42.460
takes about 3 to 4 hours for a round trip, right?

37:42.460 --> 37:44.480
By the time you come tomorrow, your condition won't be as good.

37:44.790 --> 37:46.130
Just do as I say.

37:46.270 --> 37:46.710
Liangliang.

37:46.730 --> 37:47.270
Yes?

37:47.310 --> 37:48.230
Go prepare a room.

37:48.480 --> 37:49.720
A standard room, okay?

37:50.180 --> 37:50.980
Look at the photos,

37:51.560 --> 37:52.550
then rest early.

38:05.860 --> 38:09.430
You're the only one in my heart, not her.

38:09.430 --> 38:12.810
You have to believe that my love is true.

38:13.390 --> 38:15.580
Only you are my dream.

38:15.580 --> 38:17.470
Only you can make me worry.

38:17.470 --> 38:21.040
She's not in my heart.

38:21.230 --> 38:24.790
You're the only one in my heart.

38:24.070 --> 38:24.700
[08 Chris Lee]

38:24.860 --> 38:25.970
[08 Chris Lee]

38:26.070 --> 38:26.790
Hey, Mom.

38:28.740 --> 38:29.950
It's me, Fenghua.

38:32.100 --> 38:33.750
I'm staying in the city tonight.

38:33.750 --> 38:34.950
I have another shoot tomorrow.

38:36.240 --> 38:37.870
Don't worry.

38:37.870 --> 38:39.030
I'll just stay in the room.

38:39.030 --> 38:40.190
I won't go anywhere.

38:40.210 --> 38:41.820
I'll come back right after the shoot tomorrow.

38:43.500 --> 38:45.260
I know, I know.

38:45.660 --> 38:46.960
I'm just letting you know.

38:48.370 --> 38:50.370
Okay, I'll hang up now.

38:50.650 --> 38:51.500
Bye.

38:56.890 --> 39:00.360
You're the only one in my heart, not her.

39:00.430 --> 39:03.890
You have to believe that my love is true.

39:02.650 --> 39:06.340
[08 Chris Lee]

39:04.390 --> 39:06.590
Only you are my dream.

39:06.590 --> 39:09.910
Only you can make me worry.

39:09.910 --> 39:12.630
Since I sent you home that day,

39:12.630 --> 39:13.950
that day...

39:14.910 --> 39:15.830
Who is it?

39:16.230 --> 39:17.220
It's me, Hai.

39:18.590 --> 39:19.800
Is something up?

39:20.430 --> 39:22.060
I have some good news for you.

39:22.090 --> 39:24.130
The client is extremely satisfied

39:24.200 --> 39:26.090
with the photographs we took today.

39:26.320 --> 39:27.440
They insist on treating you to dinner.

39:28.030 --> 39:29.390
I've already eaten.

39:29.390 --> 39:30.350
Maybe next time?

39:30.350 --> 39:31.030
No.

39:31.030 --> 39:32.550
The client is downstairs right now.

39:32.550 --> 39:34.430
Just go down quickly and say hello.

39:34.430 --> 39:35.790
Have a couple of drinks and it'll be over.

39:39.180 --> 39:41.460
Well, I'm tired.

39:41.480 --> 39:43.090
I want to rest early.

39:43.210 --> 39:43.890
It's okay.

39:44.110 --> 39:45.100
It won't take long.

39:45.130 --> 39:46.740
It won't take long, really.

39:46.760 --> 39:47.690
It's just downstairs.

39:47.730 --> 39:49.260
Besides, those people are all respectable.

39:49.280 --> 39:50.360
They won't do anything inappropriate.

39:51.960 --> 39:52.750
Come on, open the door.

39:52.800 --> 39:54.190
I can't afford to offend a big client.

39:54.230 --> 39:54.900
Open the door.

39:55.260 --> 39:58.290
Your contract didn’t say anything about meeting clients.

40:06.710 --> 40:07.720
What are you doing?

40:07.750 --> 40:09.150
It's just going down to say hello.

40:09.150 --> 40:10.430
What's wrong with having a couple of drinks?

40:10.430 --> 40:11.550
I don't drink.

40:11.550 --> 40:12.770
Then just make do with soft drinks.

40:12.810 --> 40:13.470
They really...

40:13.470 --> 40:14.030
I'm telling you,

40:14.030 --> 40:14.910
they're all respectable people.

40:14.910 --> 40:15.880
I told you I'm not going.

40:15.880 --> 40:17.840
Don't you understand what I'm saying?

40:18.190 --> 40:19.440
Don't shout.

40:20.430 --> 40:22.030
This is a task arranged by the company for you,

40:22.030 --> 40:22.670
isn't it?

40:22.690 --> 40:24.500
If you don’t go, wouldn’t that be a breach of contract?

40:25.510 --> 40:27.500
You are just having dinner, not sleeping with them.

40:27.550 --> 40:28.550
Don't pull me!

40:28.550 --> 40:29.230
Let's go.

40:29.270 --> 40:29.990
Let go of me.

40:30.010 --> 40:30.870
Help!

40:30.870 --> 40:32.220
You're trying to run away?

40:33.190 --> 40:34.230
Are you taking my kindness for granted?

40:34.270 --> 40:35.410
Who do you think you are?

40:35.440 --> 40:37.560
You think it's so easy to earn 1000 yuan?

40:37.590 --> 40:40.450
Trying to run away? Who do you think you are?

40:40.790 --> 40:42.320
What’s wrong with asking you to join in for a drink?

40:42.350 --> 40:43.910
Even international models have to entertain clients.

40:43.910 --> 40:44.510
Why can't you do it?

40:44.550 --> 40:45.020
Help!

40:45.020 --> 40:46.490
Why can't you just have a drink with them?

40:46.690 --> 40:48.040
Someone help!

40:48.600 --> 40:49.150
Help!

40:49.190 --> 40:50.950
You think it's so easy to earn 10,000 yuan?

40:51.020 --> 40:52.430
That money is easy money, huh?

40:52.430 --> 40:53.400
Are you going or not?

40:53.430 --> 40:54.400
Scream?

40:54.430 --> 40:55.770
Who's coming even with your screams?

41:05.520 --> 41:06.560
How dare you hit me?

41:06.750 --> 41:07.980
Wait and see.

41:08.010 --> 41:09.260
Come back!

41:10.110 --> 41:11.760
Come back! Don't run!

41:12.770 --> 41:14.800
Stop! Come back! Stop!

41:14.830 --> 41:16.430
Come back if you don't want to die!

41:32.110 --> 41:34.080
What's wrong? Can't run anymore?

41:34.810 --> 41:36.760
Let's rest for a bit.

41:36.780 --> 41:38.060
What happened to your leg?

41:43.980 --> 41:45.430
How did you get hurt?

41:45.760 --> 41:46.640
I...

41:46.680 --> 41:48.360
When I was fighting him earlier,

41:48.390 --> 41:49.810
I must have gotten cut.

41:50.360 --> 41:52.290
It's fine, no broken bones.

41:56.230 --> 41:56.980
It hurts, doesn't it?

42:06.190 --> 42:07.350
Sit here and don't move.

42:07.380 --> 42:08.700
I'll go find a pharmacy.

42:12.940 --> 42:13.870
Don't go.

42:20.800 --> 42:22.040
Come on, I'll carry you on my back.

42:30.500 --> 42:32.710
You usually act all bold.

42:32.980 --> 42:34.600
But when something happens, you cower away.

42:34.880 --> 42:35.800
I despise you.

42:38.900 --> 42:41.550
If you dare tell anyone about what happened today,

42:41.820 --> 42:43.010
I'll kill you.

42:44.620 --> 42:45.530
I won't say anything.

42:55.030 --> 42:56.430
If you want to cry, just let it out.

42:57.600 --> 42:58.650
I won't laugh at you.
